The Scripture quoted in this wallpaper is public domain (World English Bible,
Updated, eBible.org).  The Greek is OpenGNT; the Hebrew is the Open Scriptures
Hebrew Bible with STEPBible glosses; the catechisms, the creeds and the Book of
Common Prayer (1928) tables are public domain.  None of those projects are
affiliated with this one — it is a wallpaper that points at studytools.cc,
which serves them all.
